---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
const email = SITE.contactEmail;
---
<PageLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Get in touch with SkillSprint to report a mistake in a question, suggest a new game or ask about the site."
  heading="Contact"
  narrow
>
  <p>We would love to hear from you — especially if you have found a mistake in a question or explanation, or have an idea for a new challenge.</p>
  {email ? (
    <p>Email us at <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>. Please include the game name and, for quiz questions, the question text so we can find it quickly.</p>
  ) : (
    <p>A contact email address has not been published yet. Until it is, you can still find answers to common questions on the <a href="/about/">About page</a> and in the guides below each game.</p>
  )}
  <h2>Before you write</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Lost scores?</strong> Results are stored only in your browser on the device where you played. We cannot see or restore them.</li>
    <li><strong>Reaction times seem slow?</strong> Displays, wireless mice and browsers all add latency. Compare results on the same device.</li>
    <li><strong>Privacy questions?</strong> See the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
